[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17282.868, "timestamp": "04:48:02", "text": "泰米尔语：不，不，维克多是在用泰米尔语说话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17286.15, "timestamp": "04:48:06", "text": "我当时在用泰米尔语说话，呃，还有一些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17287.91, "timestamp": "04:48:07", "text": "这些话翻译成我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17291.59, "timestamp": "04:48:11", "text": "语言：马拉雅拉姆语。哦等等，是的，呃，DJ们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17293.91, "timestamp": "04:48:13", "text": "也来自"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17297.75, "timestamp": "04:48:17", "text": "所以，是的，当它回来的时候。是的，如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17300.47, "timestamp": "04:48:20", "text": "DJsc，你有什么东西吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17303.11, "timestamp": "04:48:23", "text": "可以在聊天框里输入。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17307.35, "timestamp": "04:48:27", "text": "是的，你可以继续在聊天框里输入内容。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17310.39, "timestamp": "04:48:30", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17316.31, "timestamp": "04:48:36", "text": "说实话，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17329.67, "timestamp": "04:48:49", "text": "所以，呃，早些时候，呃，我们，呃，聊天中没有Fujiun。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17334.07, "timestamp": "04:48:54", "text": "呃，他写道，呃，因为我有一个水瓶"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17337.59, "timestamp": "04:48:57", "text": "在侧面。于是他写了《马拉雅》。"}]